|---|---|---|
| H (truncation horizon) | 20 | 20 |
| γ = inf ‖∇^F ℒ_self‖_{g_F} (outside 𝒩) | 0.23 | 0.23 |
| M = sup ‖∇^F I_rare‖_{g_F} | 1.47 | 14.7 (10× increase) |
| L (ℒ_self smoothness constant) | 12.4 | 12.4 |
| L_I(𝒦, H) (InfoNCE-anchor Lipschitz constant) | 8.9 | 8.9 |
